 技能）\n目标：让“自主智能式工作”感觉像一个产品，而不是一个终端。","tags":["opencode","人工智能","大语言模型","智能体","自主智能"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://openwork.software/","releaseDate":"2026-02-10","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/different-ai/openwork/releases/tag/v0.11.41","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.41/DifferentAI.OpenWork.yaml","sha256":"2b33e81df16b0a68fe88ac3fd5943b93c2609f08ae6e036e487118d7f9361642"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.41/DifferentAI.OpenWork.installer.yaml","sha256":"c188bb3617eb8056e925fa2bd8096d71b47eb6cb6c348470749d3c9f8196a75c"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.41/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"097a98810f0a99ee04df5e93ec964246719cb921bcf34869952ce3aceed4e777"},{"path":"manifests/d/DifferentAI/OpenWork/0.11.41/DifferentAI.OpenWork.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"62af5b4f3068a2832e8369f36c877645fd89a730ce5ed1b5980eb5eac0b60d74"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.11.41"}